<title>USA: AW Computer Systems delisted.</title>
<headline>AW Computer Systems delisted.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNT LAUREL, N.J. 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>AW Computer Systems Inc said on Thursday the National Association of Securities Dealers (NASD) has delisted the company for failing to meet capital and surplus requirements for the Nasdaq.</p>
<p>The company's class A common stock will now be traded on the over-the-counter bulletin board market, it said.</p>
